    "message": "fix(updates): key the creation-time lookup off the real platform\n\nThe staging test flips _WINDOWS to exercise that path on Linux CI, which made\nthe creation-time lookup call ctypes.WinDLL there and fail. The Win32 call now\nkeys off os.name so the flag only routes behaviour, never platform APIs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
